/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 245 0 R
/E (The Index is an equity index administered by BITA, calculated by BITA and based on a model designed by Melanion Capital. The Index is composed of a maximum of 30 securities with capitalizations greater than 100MUSD listed on the markets of Europe and America, of companies operating in the segments of asset management and "Crypto" trading, services "Crypto" banks, "Crypto Mining" and Blockchain technology, or companies that hold Crypto currencies on their balance sheet. )
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [22]
